   526	   * contenders started at once cannot both be "directly blocked by the holder", since whichever
   527	   * reaches the lock manager first becomes the other's blocker). The read is thereby guaranteed to
   528	   * be granted first, so its cursor is set from `last_message_seq` as it stood BEFORE the send's
